# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Added 2026-10-17. The repo is PUBLIC, so it carries the source only: code,
# docs and the cropped icons the app actually ships. Three kinds of large
# artwork stay out (~585 MB), and none of it is needed to read or edit the code.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# 1. Generated copies of the web app. autopush.sh (and the manual sync step)
#    rebuilds both from the root files, so committing them just stores the
#    same bytes two more times.
www/
ios/App/App/public/

# 2. Persona photos (500 card images + 135 profile pictures, ~141 MB) and the
#    design-reference archive (~86 MB). Keep your local copies: a fresh clone
#    will run, but the swipe deck will have no artwork until these are restored.
assets/characters/
design-refs/

# 3. Raw reference sheets the icons were cropped from — source material, never
#    loaded by the app. The cropped results next to them ARE committed.
